[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（翌日。いよいよグループ実習の成果を発表する日）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The next day. It was finally time to present our group practical results.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "レスナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Resna"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "学校は勉強するところです。でも、それ以上に\n同年代の若者が友情を育む場でもあります",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "School is a place for learning. But more than that, it's also a place where young people of the same age nurture friendships."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "生徒たちは思い出に残るような青春の時間を\n学校に求めている……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Students look to school for memorable experiences during their youth..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "生徒会のとったアンケートの結果にも、\nそのような回答が数多くありました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The results of the student council survey showed many responses along these lines."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そこで私たちが作ったのが、こちらです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So here's what we've created."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "メモとペン、かしら？\n特に変わったものには見えないけれど……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Notepads and pens? They don't look particularly special..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いただきます、あむ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thank you, *munch*..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……！\u3000あらあら",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...! Well, well."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "このメモ、実は食べられるんです。\n付属のペンで、味も変えられます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This notepad is actually edible. And the pen can change the notepad's flavor."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "赤ならイチゴ味、緑ならメロン味。\n同じ赤でも、激辛味とかもありますよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Red makes taste like strawberry, and green makes it taste like melon. Red can also make it super spicy."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お菓子を持ち込むのが禁止の学校でも、\nこれなら見つからずに食べられる。生徒の味方です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Even at schools where snacks are prohibited, students can eat these without fear of getting caught. It's a student's best friend."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なるほど、面白いわね。激辛があることで、\n罰ゲームとかにも使える。話題になりそうだわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see, that's interesting. Having the spicy option means it could be used for punishments as well. This could become quite popular."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それだけじゃありません。なんと、食べると\nメモに書いた内容が頭に浮かんでくるんです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's not all. When you eat it, the contents written on the memo will fill your mind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "友達との待ち合わせのメモを書いて食べて覚える、\nなんて使い方もできます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You could write down a meeting time with friends, eat it, and instantly commit it to memory."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "告白する勇気が無い子が、ラブレターを書いて\n中身を見ずに食べてもらう、なんてことも……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A shy person could write a love letter and have their crush eat it without seeing the contents..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "テスト前に授業の内容を書いて食べるなんてことも\nできちゃいそうだけど？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Couldn't students also write down lecture notes and eat them before tests?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "一枚で満腹感が得られるように作っていて、\n一度にたくさんは覚えられないので大丈夫です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We've designed each sheet to provide an accompany level of satiety, so you can't eat and memorize too much at once."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "学生生活を豊かでワクワクしたものに。動画映えも\nしますし、ＳＮＳでもバズを狙えるんじゃないかと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "It makes student life richer and more exciting. It also presents very well in photos and could go viral on social media."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふむ……確かに面白いわね。\nありがとう、では次のグループの準備をお願い",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... it is interesting indeed. Thank you. Now, let's prepare for the next group."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "承知いたしました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Understood."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "お疲れさま、クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Well done, Klaudia."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう。でも、本番は……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Thanks. But the real thing is..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "本番？\u3000って、今のじゃないの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The real thing? Wasn't that it?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ライザ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ryza"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん、ちょっと別の話",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, there's something else."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "クラウディア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Klaudia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では、私たちのグループの発表を行います",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Now then, our group will present."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら？\u3000あなたしかいないみたいだけど",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh? It looks like you're the only one here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "他のメンバーは、やることがありますので",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The other members have things to take care of."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふうん……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I see..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "時間は大切です。端的に行きましょう。\n私たちが作ったのは、チョークです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Time is precious. Let's be brief. What we've created is chalk."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "チョーク？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Chalk?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい。もちろん、ただのチョークではありません。\n付属のライトで照らすと、一瞬で文字が消えます",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes. Of course, not just ordinary chalk. When illuminated with this special light, the writing disappears instantly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どんなに黒板に文字を書き込んだとしても、\nこのライトでさっと照らすだけでまっさらに元通りです",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No matter how much you write on the blackboard, simply shining this light will return it to a blank slate."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これまでの黒板消しでは、文字を消すのに多少の時間が\nかかっていました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "With conventional erasers, it takes some time to clear the blackboard."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "完全に綺麗にしようとするとなおさらです。\nこれが積み重なると馬鹿にならない時間になります",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Especially if you want it completely clean - the time required adds up significantly."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "教師の働き方改革が取り沙汰されている昨今、\n教師にとって何より大切なのは時間です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "In these times when teacher workloads are being scrutinized, time is the most precious resource for educators."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "その一助となればという想いでこちらを作りました",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We created this hoping to help solve that problem."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ほう……けれど、お高いんでしょう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... but I imagine something like that would be quite expensive?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "既存のチョークの単価が１本１０コールです。\n今回のチョークの単価は１本８コールにできるかと",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "The current unit price for chalk is 10 Cole per piece. We can provide our chalk at 8 Cole per piece."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あら、安いのね。でも、そんなに安くして\n採算がとれるのかしら？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh my, that's even cheaper than regular chalk. Can you really turn a profit at that price?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……学校に提供するチョークだけでは、\n正直採算は取れないでしょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...To be honest, just selling chalk to schools won't be profitable."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ですので、新たな価値を生みだします",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So we've got an additional use case in mind."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "新たな価値？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Additional use case?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、それを今からお見せしたいのですが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes, I'd like to demonstrate that now..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "どうしたの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's wrong?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……その、もう少しお時間をいただけないでしょうか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Could we have a little more time, please?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "嫌よ。教師にとって何より大切なのは時間。\nそう言ったのはあなたでしょう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No. Time is the most precious resource for teachers. Those were your own words."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そう、ですね……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Yes... indeed..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふむ……ほかに見せられるものが無ければ、\nあなたたちの発表は、これで終わ――",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm... if you have nothing else to show, then your presentation is over--"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ザスキア",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Saskia"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "プラフタ！\u3000完成したよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta! We finished it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……！\u3000本当ですか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...! Really?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ザスキア先生。皆さん。お願いします。\nグラウンドへお越しいただけませんか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Miss Saskia. Everyone. Please, could you all come to the school grounds?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……いいでしょう",
