    }
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "私たちのチョークは、特殊な光が当たると消えます。\nその光を出す花火です",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Our chalk disappears when exposed to a special light. These fireworks emit that light."
